{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And upon you and upon your people.</b> Yefet said: because Scripture said \"and upon you and upon your people,\" it hints that the [frogs] shall come up upon him and upon his people alone, and not upon the people of Israel. But this is no proof, for he mentioned that they shall come up upon him and upon all his people, and there is no need to mention Israel."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:29.445274389Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}